<title>INDIA: India's ITC Hotels 96/97 1st hlf net up.</title>
<headline>India's ITC Hotels 96/97 1st hlf net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30,1996</p>
<p>		   (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    59.4    vs    42.3</p>
<p>    Income from operations   493.6    vs   452.6</p>
<p>    Other income		  10.1    vs    14.1</p>
<p>    Expenditure		  387.9    vs   347.9</p>
<p>    Interest			23.8    vs    51.1</p>
<p>    Gross profit		  92.0    vs    67.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  21.6    vs    17.3</p>
<p>    Tax			     11.0    vs     8.1</p>
<p>Note: ITC Hotels is part of Indian tobacco and hotels conglomerate ITC Ltd. It said it expected its performance to be considerably better in the second half of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
